                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Current originating user session and current owner/membership are required on every retry. A running Job becomes cancelling with held funds and resource occupancy unchanged. Completed delivery is never undone. Queue-only cancellation may settle zero before execution; independent cleanup/settlement remain required for started work. Source content and new-spend grants are not needed to stop the original Job.",
